flowchart TD
    Start([Browser lands]) --> AuthGate[AuthGate wraps Router]
    AuthGate --> Me[/auth/me/]
    Me -->|401 anon| Login[LoginScreen]
    Me -->|200 cookie| Authed[Authenticated]
    Login -->|Microsoft| Entra[Entra ID OIDC common/v2.0]
    Login -->|Guest dev| Fake[/auth/login/fake/]
    Entra --> Issuer{Issuer in allow-list?}
    Issuer -->|yes| Callback[Callback + cookie]
    Issuer -->|no| Reject[Reject tenant]
    Fake -->|loopback| DevCookie[DevCookie HttpOnly]
    Fake -->|remote| Deny[404 outside loopback]
    Callback --> ReturnUrl{Local path only?}
    DevCookie --> ReturnUrl
    ReturnUrl -->|yes| Authed
    ReturnUrl -->|no| Login
    Reject --> Login
    Deny --> Login
    Authed --> Done([Same-origin WASM])